        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The outcome was a runoff election outcome where a politician was unseated. Now, the next act in the political circus unfolds: a future political contest that could reshape control of the U.S. Senate as Paxton faces a Democratic state Representative.",
